 163:./core_cm4.h  **** /**
 164:./core_cm4.h  ****   \brief   Data Synchronization Barrier
 165:./core_cm4.h  ****   \details Acts as a special kind of Data Memory Barrier.
 166:./core_cm4.h  ****            It completes when all explicit memory accesses before this instruction complete.
